# From power-on to the first fight in Narshe, on Final Fantasy III 1.1 with no battery save:
#
#     ostinato-damage-trace <rom> <directory> --to-battle first-fight.inputs
#
# The format is in machine_state.h.

# The title sequence: A starts the game.
780 A
788 -

# The opening runs by itself as far as the soldiers on the cliff. A moves their talk on.
6300 A
6308 -
7260 A
7268 -

# Up is held from here on. It walks the party on when the talk ends.
7900 Up
7980 Up+A
7988 Up

# The soldiers move on and the scene changes to the town.
9180 Up+A
9188 Up

# In Narshe: A moves Wedge's order on, and the party walks north.
9660 Up+A
9668 Up

# The guards in the road: A closes what they say, and the fight begins.
10140 Up+A
10148 Up
